GetQuote_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given tokenIn unconfigured
│  └── it should revert with UnknownPair
├── given tokenOut unconfigured
│  └── it should revert with UnknownPair
└── given both configured
   ├── given same decimals
   │  ├── when prices equal
   │  │  └── it should return amountIn
   │  └── when tokenIn price is half of tokenOut price
   │     └── it should return amountIn / 2
   ├── given tokenIn has fewer decimals than tokenOut
   │  └── it should scale by 10^(outDec - inDec)
   └── given tokenIn has more decimals than tokenOut
      └── it should scale by 1 / 10^(inDec - outDec)
